  "notes": "{売|う}り{切|き}れる is a compound verb meaning to be completely sold.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {自動詞|じどうし} (intransitive)\n- Related noun: {売|う}り{切|き}れ (sold-out state)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- チケットが{売|う}り{切|き}れる (tickets sell out)\n- {完売|かんばい}する (to be sold out - formal)\n- {売|う}り{切|き}れている (is sold out - state)\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{売|う}り{切|き}れている indicates the resulting state of being sold out, not an ongoing process.",
